epairs. Bots use ordinary actions and full damage/resources. These are skilled automatic runs, not human novice timing.\\\\n- State summary, two-phase developer selection, pad seed digit entry, immediate numeric tuning and reliable complete world snapshots with movement/repair acknowledgments are implemented. Remote positional interpolation is draw-only.\\\\n-13 distinct issues recorded in evidence/issues.json;1critical (cell-boundary erosion). All listed fixes implemented. Report src/report.json finalized around that evidence but must rebuild and verify exact artifact.\\\\n- README.md, evidence/research.md, vendor/engine/PATCHES.md and vendor/hub/PROVENANCE.md written. Engine and Hub remain unmodified.\\\\n- Remaining: inspect latest emitter/core and repaired phone/control/credit captures; await full suite; build finalized report, rerun final artifact checks; write evidence verification summary and final progress completion.\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
