=2,ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Final resize follow-up\\\\n- Full packaged suite passed133 checks with0failures, including the added ordinary native local co-op campaign (182.76s,6980points, contributions4130/2850; no dev assistance).\\\\n- Final resize review found one additional About-page edge case: portrait can create more report pages than landscape. Clamp the current page and make draw choose a valid page; add last-page rotation coverage to both touch profiles. Issue total14,1critical. Rebuild and rerun final package verification after this fix.\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\nPY\nnode tools/build.mjs\nnode tools/test.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
